<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-cyrtoloma-turing-wavelength-s0-overall> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Drosophila cyrtoloma Turing carrier at 4.3 µm (Pass 1 diagnostic) — MorphoEval overall 79.2/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Pass 1 integrates the diffusivity sweep only to γt = 0.55. The activator has not selected a wavelength, and Pearson r against the linear λ(σ) is 0.906. The equal-diffusion control, Otsu segmentation, spacing CV/KS, and the domain-length count are specified as remediation and scored in v2. Overall 79.2/100 (faithfulness 76.0, reproducibility 86.8); rubric morphoeval 0.1.0; checkpoint commit 0c76d15d14afcec6c366e1b9274a6586a0de48fc; environment: . Dimension assessments: Model fidelity to source 82, Morphological realism / specimen match 74, Parameter expressivity 72, Morphometric validation 74, Source and data traceability 90, Code-to-model traceability 84, Reproducibility package 86. Output judged: docs/media/drosophila_cyrtoloma_turing_wavelength_s0_comparison.png: rendered output of models/2026-delphi10000-drosophila-cyrtoloma-turing-wavelength-s0.py at 0c76d15d14afcec6c366e1b9274a6586a0de48fc, image/png, 823511 B, 1344×1008 px, artifact_sha256 f9e516d6baf1e7152c1cbde868522975489182582cd75e66da16a910ba0bbe19 (sha256 f9e516d6baf1e7152c1cbde868522975489182582cd75e66da16a910ba0bbe19), spec_fingerprint 9a348d1b6c0648f573bdd67fbb5ddd58de163dee9a214d6c7b1eca5585a2eda8. Dual provenance: spec_fingerprint: 9a348d1b6c0648f573bdd67fbb5ddd58de163dee9a214d6c7b1eca5585a2eda8; artifact_sha256: f9e516d6baf1e7152c1cbde868522975489182582cd75e66da16a910ba0bbe19; input_dataset_sha256: {datasets/drosophila_cyrtoloma_turing_wavelength_s0/drosophila_cyrtoloma_specimen.jpg=a274390f57aa205d..., datasets/drosophila_cyrtoloma_turing_wavelength_s0/drosophila_cyrtoloma_turing_wavelength_s0_reference.json=dbe207001ca2facb..., datasets/drosophila_cyrtoloma_turing_wavelength_s0/paper_citations.bib=bd4d7e6a882797ef..., datasets/drosophila_cyrtoloma_turing_wavelength_s0/scout_manifest.json=6de58dd5861c376c...}. Claim boundary: reported_in_source: Turing 1952 dispersion conditions and critical wavenumber k_c | Schnakenberg 1979 two-species kinetics | Edwards et al. 2007 Hawaiian picture-wing diversity | Loeschcke, Bundgaard and Barker 1999 buzzatii wing and thorax size reaction norms; reconstructed_in_script: 4.315 µm assignment for the cyrtoloma melanin carrier | 7.84 µm buzzatii and 6.05 µm deflecta chronoseries hypotheses; transfer_boundary: Gallery spiral plate is a long-wave prepattern, not a measured cuticle micrograph; does_not_claim: That 4.315 µm was measured on this species in the cited papers | That buzzatii is a cladistic ancestor or deflecta a descendant | That DOI 10.11646/zootaxa.2400.1.1 is about Drosophila cyrtoloma." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-rubric-0.1.0> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/grok-4.7> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/overall" ;
    pk:evidenceAgainst "remediation needed: Replace the γt=0.55 diffusivity sweep (Pearson r = 0.906) with the developed domain-length peak count and require r > 0.98.",
        "remediation needed: Report inter-peak spacing CV and a KS statistic for the 4.315 µm carrier.",
        "remediation needed: Report the equal-diffusion ablation (Dv = Du) beside the focal activator standard deviation.",
        "remediation needed: Segment the vendored plate with Otsu and report circularity and coherency with value unequal to the reference.",
        "remediation needed: Simulate the buzzatii and deflecta carriers on the same grid spacing and check the wavelength order." ;
    pk:hasScore 7.92e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "mostly faithful" .

